      "writtenOn": "2026-10-29T21:16:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please explain 128. Is it a common CPU cache line size?\n\nIf the CPU cache line size is 64, do we run into this problem when the width is a multiple of 64?",
      "revId": "978dc959d997f6886d22da561fdfe086e43558dc",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
